OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786711712
OL,3,CWoman admits causing baby son's death
OL,4,Cand attempting to murder daughter
OL,6,FA 34-year old woman has admitted
OL,7,Fcausing the death of her baby son and
OL,8,Fattempting to murder her daughter.
OL,10,FThe woman, who can't be named due to a
OL,11,Freporting restriction, wept in the
OL,12,Fdock of Belfast Crown Court on
OL,13,FThursday.
OL,15,FShe will be sentenced for the two
OL,16,Foffences later in August.
OL,18,FShe stood trial in 2023 on charges of
OL,19,Fmurdering her eight-week old son and
OL,20,Fattempting to murder his two-year old
OL,21,Fsister.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/7
