FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786711712
OL,3,CWoman admits causing baby son's death
OL,4,Cand attempting to murder daughter
OL,6,FBoth children sustained stab wounds
OL,7,Finflicted by their mother in their
OL,8,Fhome in July 2021.
OL,10,FThey were taken to the Royal Victoria
OL,11,FHospital for Sick Children.
OL,13,FThe young girl was successfully
OL,14,Ftreated for a stab wound to her chest
OL,15,Fbut her baby brother was pronounced
OL,16,Fdead at 9pm.
OL,18,FThe woman was convicted on both
OL,19,Fcharges in March 2023 and was later
OL,20,Fhanded a minimum 20-year sentence.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
