OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786711712
OL,3,CWoman admits causing baby son's death
OL,4,Cand attempting to murder daughter
OL,6,FIn December 2025, the two convictions
OL,7,Fwere quashed by the Court of Appeal,
OL,8,Fwith judges concluding that the guilty
OL,9,Fverdicts were unsafe.
OL,11,FThe woman's lawyers mounted a legal
OL,12,Fbid to overturn the verdicts based on
OL,13,Fissues around the trial process.
OL,15,FLady Chief Justice Dame Siobhan Keegan
OL,16,Fbacked the grounds of challenge and
OL,17,Fsaid she "cannot be satisfied that the
OL,18,Fconvictions are safe."
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786711712
OL,3,CWoman admits causing baby son's death
OL,4,Cand attempting to murder daughter
OL,6,FThe defendant was back in court on
OL,7,FThursday where her barrister Charles
OL,8,FMacCreanor KC told Mr Justice Fowler
OL,9,Fthat the Crown had an application to
OL,10,Famend the bill of indictment.
OL,12,FThis was confirmed by Crown barrister
OL,13,FSam Magee KC, who said the bill had
OL,14,Fbeen amended to include a third count.
OL,16,FWhen re-arraigned on a charge of
OL,17,Fattempting to murder her daughter she
OL,18,Freplied "guilty."
OL,20,FThe offence of infanticide was then
OL,21,Fput to the woman.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786711712
OL,3,CWoman admits causing baby son's death
OL,4,Cand attempting to murder daughter
OL,6,FShe was charged with causing the death
OL,7,Fof her child aged under 12 months by a
OL,8,Fwilful act, namely stabbing and
OL,9,Fwounding him with a knife, but at a
OL,10,Ftime when the balance of her mind was
OL,11,Fdisturbed by reason of the fact that
OL,12,Fshe had not fully recovered from the
OL,13,Feffect of giving birth to the child.
OL,15,FWhen asked to enter a plea to this
OL,16,Fcharge, she replied "guilty."
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
