FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786711712
OL,3,CWoman admits causing baby son's death
OL,4,Cand attempting to murder daughter
OL,6,FMr Justice Fowler was then addressed
OL,7,Fby Mr Magee who said that "in the
OL,8,Fcircumstances" the Crown's application
OL,9,Fwas to leave the charge of murdering
OL,10,Fthe baby "on the books" and it would
OL,11,Fnot be proceeded with.
OL,13,FThe court heard how the case had a
OL,14,F"complex history".
OL,16,FThe prosecuting barrister added that
OL,17,Fthe Crown would be seeking an update
OL,18,Fon the surviving child.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
