FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786711712
OL,3,CWoman admits causing baby son's death
OL,4,Cand attempting to murder daughter
OL,6,FMr Justice Fowler expressed a desire
OL,7,Fthat a pre-sentence report on the
OL,8,Fwoman was compiled as quickly as
OL,9,Fpossible.
OL,11,FThe woman was remanded back into
OL,12,Fcustody and is due to be sentenced on
OL,13,FAugust 27.
